  "description": "\u201cTo draw a straight line at right angles to a given straight line from a given point on it.\u201d\n\u2014 Euclid's Elements, BOOK I \u2022 PROP. 11 (G.34)\n\n00:00 1 \u00b7 GIVEN: segment AB and point C on AB\n00:07 2 \u00b7 GOAL: construct CF \u22a5 AB at C\n00:13 3 \u00b7 CONSTRUCT: take point D on AC\n00:18 4 \u00b7 CONSTRUCT: cut off CE = CD on CB\n00:24 5 \u00b7 CONSTRUCT: equilateral triangle FDE on DE\n00:29 6 \u00b7 CONSTRUCT: segment FC\n00:35 7 \u00b7 ASSERT: angle DCF = angle ECF by SSS\n00:52 8 \u00b7 \u2234: CF \u22a5 AB at point C\n\nGEOMETOR \u2022 G.34 \u2022 v2",
